%% Nerv Adapter Install Sequence
%%
%% Atomic install with rollback on hash mismatch.

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Nerv as nerv install
    participant CLI as Target CLI
    participant FS as Filesystem

    User->>Nerv: nerv install {cli}
    Nerv->>CLI: detect version
    CLI-->>Nerv: version string

    Nerv->>FS: read existing configs
    FS-->>Nerv: current config state

    Nerv->>Nerv: compute merged config
    Nerv->>Nerv: compute diff (current vs desired)
    Nerv->>User: dry-run preview

    User->>Nerv: confirm

    Nerv->>FS: acquire flock
    FS-->>Nerv: lock acquired

    Nerv->>FS: backup current config
    FS-->>Nerv: backup path

    Nerv->>FS: atomic write new config
    Nerv->>FS: verify written hash
    FS-->>Nerv: hash result

    alt hash matches expected
        Nerv->>FS: record install metadata
        Nerv->>FS: release flock
        Nerv->>User: success
    else hash mismatch
        Nerv->>FS: restore from backup
        Nerv->>FS: release flock
        Nerv->>User: error — rolled back
    end
